  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Wisdom is your spellcasting ability for your spells. You use your Wisdom whenever a spell refers to your spellcasting ability. In addition, you use your Wisdom modifier when setting the saving throw DC for a spell you cast and when making an attack roll with one.</p>\n<p>You must use a wand as a spellcasting focus for your spells. Your spell slot progression is the standard for full casters (22 slots at level 20).</p>\n<p>Additionally, when you gain a level in this class, you can choose two of the cantrips or spells you know and replace them with two new cantrips or spells, which also must be of a level for which you have spell slots.</p>",
